stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Readiness gates each replacement batch
accDescr: An updated launch template starts controlled batches. A successful readiness signal permits progress, while a timeout fails the update.
[*] --> NewVersion
NewVersion: Stack references new template version
NewVersion --> Batch
Batch: Replace one configured batch
Batch --> Wait
Wait: Keep minimum capacity in service
Wait --> Next: New instances signal readiness
Wait --> Failure: Readiness timeout
Next: More old instances?
Next --> Batch: Yes
Next --> Complete: No
Failure: Update fails, inspect rollback events
Complete --> [*]
